WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.929
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:30.199 --> 00:31.800
Ma Guowen deserved to die.

3
00:32.840 --> 00:33.679
Liu Xuemei...

4
00:34.200 --> 00:35.240
she had it coming too.

5
00:35.759 --> 00:36.719
What're you talking about?

6
00:36.880 --> 00:37.439
What?

7
00:37.759 --> 00:38.799
If it weren't for her,

8
00:39.439 --> 00:41.200
would we all have ended up like this?

9
00:42.479 --> 00:44.079
If your life's a mess, who can you blame?

10
00:44.439 --> 00:45.119
Blame who?

11
00:46.320 --> 00:46.759
Right.

12
00:47.000 --> 00:47.840
I can't blame anyone.

13
00:47.920 --> 00:48.719
What about Cao Jun?

14
00:50.159 --> 00:51.520
What about Cao Jun?

15
00:51.759 --> 00:53.119
Who did he ever cross?

16
00:53.799 --> 00:55.039
He was careful his whole life,

17
00:55.039 --> 00:56.240
scared of everything.

18
00:57.079 --> 00:58.679
Drove a forklift just fine,

19
00:58.759 --> 00:59.759
then sold tea eggs,

20
00:59.920 --> 01:01.679
and then drove a three-wheeler.

21
01:02.640 --> 01:03.920
Now he's been murdered.

22
01:04.680 --> 01:05.519
And for what?

23
01:06.799 --> 01:08.079
Isn't it all because of that tramp?

24
01:08.400 --> 01:09.400
That's enough.

25
01:09.959 --> 01:10.640
Qian Yichuan!

26
01:10.799 --> 01:11.519
They're already dead.

27
01:11.519 --> 01:12.560
Show some decency.

28
01:12.799 --> 01:13.640
If we can't talk about the dead,

29
01:13.640 --> 01:14.760
Come on, have a drink. I'll talk about the living.

30
01:15.519 --> 01:16.000
What the hell?

31
01:16.480 --> 01:18.079
What's the deal with your ex-wife?

32
01:18.319 --> 01:19.359
Why did she come back?

33
01:19.359 --> 01:20.799
To shoot a film for Ma Guowen?

34
01:21.079 --> 01:22.200
Is she on your side,

35
01:22.200 --> 01:23.480
or on Ma Guowen's?

36
01:23.640 --> 01:24.319
Back then— Are you ever gonna stop?

37
01:24.319 --> 01:25.799
Was she one of those who betrayed us?

38
01:26.159 --> 01:26.719
Just answer me.

39
01:26.799 --> 01:28.000
How much have you had to drink?

40
01:28.079 --> 01:29.760
Did she have anything to do with what happened?

41
01:29.799 --> 01:30.480
Qian Yichuan.

42
01:31.760 --> 01:32.480
Watch your mouth.

43
01:32.719 --> 01:33.400
Talk sense.

44
01:34.560 --> 01:35.599
Now that the brewery's gone,

45
01:35.760 --> 01:36.560
and you have no job,

46
01:37.840 --> 01:38.760
everyone understands.

47
01:39.560 --> 01:40.840
Stop playing Mr. Nice Guy.

48
01:41.319 --> 01:42.599
What do you mean you understand?

49
01:43.719 --> 01:44.400
What?

50
01:45.079 --> 01:45.799
Like you had nothing to do with it?

51
01:46.439 --> 01:47.920
When pooling funds to buy the plant came up,

52
01:47.920 --> 01:49.519
your eyes went wider than anyone's.

53
01:51.079 --> 01:52.159
The second the plan failed,

54
01:52.239 --> 01:53.840
you bared your teeth and turned on me.

55
01:54.879 --> 01:56.920
You took good care of your apprentices,

56
01:56.959 --> 01:57.640
but what about me?

57
01:59.319 --> 02:00.560
Did anyone ever give a damn about me?

58
02:05.159 --> 02:05.879
Qian Yichuan.

59
02:08.879 --> 02:10.039
Some things are already in the past.

60
02:13.000 --> 02:13.840
Ending up like this,

61
02:13.840 --> 02:14.879
you've got no one else to blame.

62
02:16.759 --> 02:17.520
I'm not blaming anyone else.

63
02:19.919 --> 02:21.080
I'm a piece of trash.

64
02:21.960 --> 02:22.560
A worthless life.

65
02:23.599 --> 02:24.680
A damn cripple.

66
02:27.360 --> 02:28.479
But I'm not a bad person!

67
02:29.960 --> 02:31.159
I didn't kill anyone!

68
02:34.240 --> 02:35.280
Who said you killed anyone?

69
02:39.039 --> 02:40.520
Then what did you mean by that just now?

70
02:41.080 --> 02:41.719
What did I say?

71
02:42.199 --> 02:42.759
Back up a bit.

72
02:42.759 --> 02:43.919
What did you say just now?

73
02:44.000 --> 02:44.599
What did I say?

74
02:44.599 --> 02:45.520
Don't you shove me!

75
02:45.520 --> 02:46.719
What did you mean by that earlier?

76
02:47.439 --> 02:48.520
You don't know what's good for you!

77
02:49.120 --> 02:49.680
What are you doing?

78
02:50.039 --> 02:51.479
Don't point your fingers at my master!

79
02:51.479 --> 02:52.120
What's that supposed to mean?

80
02:52.199 --> 02:52.599
Tieping!

81
02:52.719 --> 02:53.360
What do you mean by that?

82
02:53.400 --> 02:54.400
Don't wave your hands at my master!

83
02:54.400 --> 02:55.439
You wanna kill me, is that it?

84
02:55.479 --> 02:55.960
Come on! Do it!

85
02:56.280 --> 02:56.680
Tieping!

86
02:56.719 --> 02:57.280
Get out!

87
02:57.759 --> 02:58.360
Qian Yichuan, get out!

88
02:58.360 --> 02:59.360
I'll kill this bastard!

89
03:00.439 --> 03:01.080
Get out of the way!

90
03:01.360 --> 03:01.919
Move!

91
03:01.919 --> 03:02.400
Qian Yichuan!

92
03:02.439 --> 03:02.960
Get off me!

93
03:04.199 --> 03:04.639
Have you lost your mind?!

94
03:04.680 --> 03:05.280
What?!

95
03:05.360 --> 03:06.000
Beat me to death!

96
03:06.879 --> 03:07.280
Don't move!

97
03:07.319 --> 03:07.560
I...

98
03:07.560 --> 03:08.080
Qian Yichuan!

99
03:08.639 --> 03:09.199
Let go!

100
03:09.400 --> 03:10.280
If you've got the guts,

101
03:10.439 --> 03:11.280
hit me right here!

102
03:11.680 --> 03:12.439
If beating me to death

103
03:12.439 --> 03:13.240
makes you feel better,

104
03:13.400 --> 03:14.240
then go ahead and strike!

105
03:16.319 --> 03:17.800
Kill me today and you're a murderer!

106
03:18.159 --> 03:18.879
Go on, hit me!

107
03:18.919 --> 03:19.639
Look at you acting tough!

108
03:20.199 --> 03:20.840
Get out of here!

109
03:21.360 --> 03:22.159
What?!

110
03:22.280 --> 03:22.639
Tieping!

111
03:22.639 --> 03:23.319
I'll slice your kidneys out!

112
03:24.680 --> 03:26.000
Go! Move!

113
03:26.560 --> 03:27.159
You're drunk!

114
03:27.199 --> 03:27.719
Get inside!

115
03:36.520 --> 03:37.479
Sit down, sit down.

116
03:40.520 --> 03:41.319
Sit down. Don't mind him.

117
03:41.719 --> 03:42.479
Psycho.

118
03:44.120 --> 03:45.039
Come on, sit down.

119
03:47.120 --> 03:47.879
Who does he think he is?

120
03:47.879 --> 03:48.360
Come on.

121
03:49.800 --> 03:50.680
Tieping's had too much to drink.

122
03:51.360 --> 03:51.840
Just sit.

123
03:56.840 --> 03:57.840
The kid doesn't know any better.

124
04:02.919 --> 04:03.759
Look...

125
04:06.120 --> 04:06.719
It's not Tieping's fault.

126
04:07.719 --> 04:08.680
I ruined the mood.

127
04:10.759 --> 04:11.599
Let me chug one.

128
04:12.360 --> 04:12.879
Haipeng.

129
04:25.720 --> 04:26.560
As for me,

130
04:27.279 --> 04:28.079
in a bit,

131
04:28.560 --> 04:30.160
I'll go take a nap on the train tracks.

132
04:30.600 --> 04:31.240
What do you think?

133
04:58.839 --> 04:59.639
Aren't you going to help him?

134
05:02.399 --> 05:03.600
None of my damn business.

135
05:04.759 --> 05:06.240
Let him sleep on the tracks forever.

136
05:07.319 --> 05:07.839
When a train comes,

137
05:07.839 --> 05:08.480
he'd better not get up.

138
05:08.600 --> 05:09.439
Let it run him over.

139
05:15.399 --> 05:16.319
Originally,

140
05:17.399 --> 05:19.240
I wanted everyone

141
05:20.120 --> 05:21.000
to get together

142
05:21.079 --> 05:22.040
and discuss

143
05:22.560 --> 05:23.519
those two

144
05:24.240 --> 05:25.360
murder cases.

145
05:26.120 --> 05:26.480
But

146
05:26.680 --> 05:27.439
who would've thought

147
05:28.519 --> 05:29.839
our own people

148
05:31.240 --> 05:31.839
would start fighting each other.

149
05:33.399 --> 05:34.600
If we aren't united,

150
05:36.199 --> 05:37.759
nothing gets done.

151
05:47.680 --> 05:49.240
Who do you think you're chopping at over there?

152
07:32.720 --> 07:33.839
I'll kick things off.

153
07:35.240 --> 07:37.480
Tomorrow is the day of the auction.

154
07:38.439 --> 07:39.560
These past few days,

155
07:39.680 --> 07:41.160
those with money chipped in,

156
07:41.279 --> 07:42.279
and those with strength pitched in.

157
07:42.560 --> 07:44.079
For our common goal,

158
07:44.240 --> 07:45.399
we've all sacrificed a lot.

159
07:45.959 --> 07:47.199
We finally raised all the money.

160
07:47.240 --> 07:47.759
Great!

161
07:48.680 --> 07:49.560
Comrade Liu Xuemei

162
07:50.040 --> 07:51.560
went to Qingzhou on our behalf

163
07:51.720 --> 07:54.519
to handle the auction paperwork.

164
07:54.600 --> 07:56.720
Great!

165
07:58.839 --> 08:01.040
As we welcome the new century,

166
08:01.319 --> 08:04.319
and a new chapter for our joint venture!

167
08:04.439 --> 08:06.160
Good, good, good!

168
08:06.439 --> 08:07.759
Hear, hear!

169
08:07.759 --> 08:08.720
Well said!

170
08:08.720 --> 08:09.279
Engineer Chen.

171
08:10.160 --> 08:11.560
Without Engineer Chen's leadership,

172
08:11.720 --> 08:12.439
this whole thing...

173
08:12.720 --> 08:13.560
would never have happened.

174
08:13.600 --> 08:14.000
That's right!

175
08:14.000 --> 08:14.439
Engineer Chen,

176
08:14.480 --> 08:15.279
say a few words to everyone.

177
08:15.279 --> 08:15.839
Say a few words!

178
08:17.279 --> 08:19.319
Chief Engineer Chen, say a few words!

179
08:19.360 --> 08:20.519
All right, I'll speak. Here goes.

180
08:20.959 --> 08:22.759
After tomorrow's auction,

181
08:22.920 --> 08:24.360
we will become Lapi Brewery's

182
08:24.680 --> 08:26.120
true partners!

183
08:26.279 --> 08:27.600
Great!

184
08:27.600 --> 08:28.240
Hear, hear!

185
08:28.240 --> 08:29.839
Let's all pull together

186
08:30.240 --> 08:31.920
and make Lapi Brewery thrive!

187
08:32.159 --> 08:32.559
You bet!

188
08:32.559 --> 08:33.360
Great!

189
08:33.519 --> 08:35.279
As for me, on the technical side,

190
08:35.639 --> 08:37.320
I'll keep strict standards for us all.

191
08:38.399 --> 08:38.840
Come on!

192
08:38.960 --> 08:41.799
Let's welcome the millennium together,

193
08:42.000 --> 08:44.440
and welcome a new dawn for Lapi Brewery!

194
08:44.519 --> 08:46.279
Great!

195
08:47.720 --> 08:48.360
Well...

196
08:49.039 --> 08:50.440
Let me say a few words.

197
08:51.240 --> 08:51.879
You know,

198
08:52.159 --> 08:53.840
things are about to get better for us.

199
08:54.399 --> 08:55.440
Look at her, grinning from ear to ear!

200
08:55.879 --> 08:56.799
What I'm thinking is,

201
08:57.080 --> 08:58.159
the Women's Federation hopes

202
08:58.399 --> 09:00.440
the brewery will provide better benefits

203
09:00.639 --> 09:01.799
for all our female comrades.

204
09:01.799 --> 09:02.799
Am I right, everyone?

205
09:02.879 --> 09:08.639
Absolutely! You bet!

206
09:09.159 --> 09:09.559
Yan,

207
09:09.639 --> 09:10.960
let's hear Qian Yichuan say a few words.

208
09:11.159 --> 09:11.440
Chuan'er, Chuan'er!

209
09:11.480 --> 09:11.799
Say a few words.

210
09:11.799 --> 09:13.120
Yeah, tell us a few words!

211
09:15.399 --> 09:17.320
Then I... I'll say a few words.

212
09:17.840 --> 09:18.960
I'm so excited today.

213
09:19.720 --> 09:20.480
First,

214
09:20.879 --> 09:22.519
thank you to all the shareholders

215
09:23.600 --> 09:24.600
for trusting us,

216
09:25.200 --> 09:26.840
and for attending today's meeting.

217
09:31.320 --> 09:31.960
A person...

218
09:32.960 --> 09:34.279
I think we gotta have dreams.

219
09:35.399 --> 09:36.559
My dream is...

220
09:40.200 --> 09:42.120
My dream is that one day,

221
09:42.960 --> 09:44.360
people all across the world

222
09:44.639 --> 09:47.240
will get to drink our Lacheng beer!

223
09:47.240 --> 09:48.679
Hear, hear!

224
09:48.679 --> 09:50.039
Great!

225
09:50.320 --> 09:51.120
Once our...

226
09:51.960 --> 09:53.360
brewery goes public,

227
09:54.799 --> 09:56.639
even private jets will be too slow for us.

228
09:57.279 --> 09:58.919
We'll be riding rockets everywhere!

229
09:59.159 --> 10:00.360
Awesome!

230
10:00.919 --> 10:02.039
Riding rockets!

231
10:02.639 --> 10:03.879
Alright, alright, alright!

232
10:04.159 --> 10:06.000
Then on behalf of the publicity department,

233
10:06.039 --> 10:06.879
I've gotta say a few words too.

234
10:07.200 --> 10:07.799
Absolutely!

235
10:07.799 --> 10:08.320
Right?

236
10:08.519 --> 10:09.240
Today,

237
10:09.879 --> 10:10.840
this gathering of ours

238
10:10.879 --> 10:11.559
is just the prologue.

239
10:12.080 --> 10:14.639
We gotta do this all the time, every year!

240
10:14.720 --> 10:15.240
Right?

241
10:15.639 --> 10:18.440
Once tomorrow's auction is over,

242
10:18.440 --> 10:19.320
we'll do something really big!

243
10:19.720 --> 10:21.679
We'll drink cross-century style!

244
10:21.840 --> 10:23.399
Great!

245
10:24.039 --> 10:24.559
Not done yet!

246
10:24.600 --> 10:25.320
Not done, not done!

247
10:25.440 --> 10:26.039
What else? Come on!

248
10:26.080 --> 10:26.559
Chuan! Chuan! Chuan!

249
10:26.720 --> 10:27.799
What? What's up?

250
10:28.320 --> 10:29.039
Come on, come on.

251
10:29.080 --> 10:29.720
What else?

252
10:29.720 --> 10:30.679
Lately,

253
10:30.679 --> 10:32.080
inspiration's just been pouring out of me!

254
10:33.240 --> 10:35.320
Following up on what Chuan said,

255
10:35.919 --> 10:39.240
I came up with a new slogan for our brewery!

256
10:39.399 --> 10:39.840
Listen up.

257
10:40.639 --> 10:41.639
Eight words:

258
10:42.240 --> 10:44.039
Lacheng Beer,

259
10:44.240 --> 10:46.279
Intoxicating the World!

260
10:46.440 --> 10:48.120
Lacheng Beer,

261
10:48.159 --> 10:50.039
Intoxicating the World!

262
10:59.919 --> 11:03.559
The old Lacheng Brewery,

263
11:03.759 --> 11:07.279
Full of sunshine and hope,

264
11:07.639 --> 11:10.960
The aroma of our beer

265
11:11.039 --> 11:14.759
Drifting far and wide.

266
11:58.399 --> 11:59.600
There's definitely no problem with this.

267
11:59.840 --> 12:00.840
We're having dumplings tonight.

268
12:01.120 --> 12:01.679
Yeah!

269
12:01.679 --> 12:02.639
Who made these dumplings?

270
12:02.639 --> 12:03.240
For so many people?

271
12:03.240 --> 12:04.320
Who made them? Did you?

272
12:04.679 --> 12:05.440
What's going on outside?

273
12:05.440 --> 12:06.039
What's all this?

274
12:06.039 --> 12:06.759
What happened?

275
12:06.799 --> 12:07.399
What's going on?

276
12:07.399 --> 12:08.080
No idea.

277
12:08.559 --> 12:09.120
What's the deal?

278
12:09.279 --> 12:10.039
Why's the main gate locked?

279
12:10.320 --> 12:11.120
Open up, will you?

280
12:11.120 --> 12:11.639
Hold on.

281
12:12.320 --> 12:13.000
What's going on here?

282
12:13.000 --> 12:14.039
Listen up, all of you!

283
12:14.320 --> 12:15.679
A thief broke into our plant!

284
12:15.799 --> 12:16.200
Say what?

285
12:16.279 --> 12:17.639
Every workshop, every department!

286
12:17.840 --> 12:19.159
Right now, this instant,

287
12:19.480 --> 12:20.919
get back inside and get screened!

288
12:21.159 --> 12:22.639
Don't loiter outside without a reason!

289
12:22.679 --> 12:24.159
What thief?

290
12:24.559 --> 12:24.960
Open the gate!

291
12:24.960 --> 12:25.840
Open it up!

292
12:26.200 --> 12:27.279
Cheng Youtian, what's your problem?

293
12:27.279 --> 12:28.279
Can't you understand me?

294
12:28.480 --> 12:29.759
I said a thief broke into the factory!

295
12:29.960 --> 12:31.440
A thief? Then go catch him!

296
12:31.440 --> 12:32.120
Why the hell are you blocking us?

297
12:32.120 --> 12:32.519
Exactly!

298
12:32.519 --> 12:34.039
Why block us? Right?

299
12:34.440 --> 12:35.159
Where's the director?

300
12:35.879 --> 12:37.480
Does the director have to report to you?

301
12:38.519 --> 12:39.480
Let me tell you,

302
12:39.879 --> 12:41.480
I'm standing guard right here,

303
12:41.600 --> 12:42.840
and let's see which of you gets out!

304
12:50.840 --> 12:51.399
So what now?

305
12:51.399 --> 12:52.519
We can't even go home?

306
13:01.639 --> 13:02.600
Over here! Come here!

307
13:02.679 --> 13:03.080
Hurry!

308
13:04.919 --> 13:05.639
What's this supposed to mean?

309
13:05.799 --> 13:06.519
What do we do now?

310
13:06.519 --> 13:07.159
We can't get out!

311
13:07.240 --> 13:08.720
They're clearly blocking us in.

312
13:08.840 --> 13:09.799
It's—it's okay.

313
13:10.000 --> 13:10.600
If we can't take this gate,

314
13:10.600 --> 13:11.559
we'll just use another one.

315
13:11.919 --> 13:12.639
Head to the east gate!

316
13:12.759 --> 13:13.200
The east gate!

317
13:13.200 --> 13:13.879
Tieping is back!

318
13:14.320 --> 13:14.840
How is it?

319
13:15.120 --> 13:15.440
Tieping!

320
13:15.440 --> 13:16.159
Slow down, take a breath. How is it?

321
13:16.159 --> 13:16.960
What's the situation at the east gate?

322
13:17.320 --> 13:18.320
Someone locked the east gate!

323
13:18.759 --> 13:19.080
The east gate?

324
13:19.120 --> 13:19.600
East gate, the east gate...

325
13:19.600 --> 13:20.320
Let's go, try the west gate!

326
13:20.360 --> 13:21.000
Head to the west gate!

327
13:21.799 --> 13:22.240
The west gate!

328
13:23.000 --> 13:23.519
Careful!

329
13:23.679 --> 13:24.559
The west—west gate?

330
13:24.600 --> 13:25.480
It's surrounded by people!

331
13:25.639 --> 13:26.360
There's no way out!

332
13:26.600 --> 13:27.360
Then let's climb the wall!

333
13:27.840 --> 13:29.039
Climbing won't work either!

334
13:29.039 --> 13:30.320
There are people all along the wall,

335
13:30.399 --> 13:31.519
and they're holding clubs!

336
13:31.559 --> 13:32.080
Chief Engineer Chen is here!

337
13:32.080 --> 13:33.000
Chief Engineer Chen!

338
13:33.000 --> 13:34.039
Engineer Chen! Engineer Chen!

339
13:34.960 --> 13:36.200
What's going on?

340
13:36.639 --> 13:38.840
Ma Guowen gathered a mob.

341
13:39.639 --> 13:41.519
Right outside the auction venue,

342
13:41.960 --> 13:43.360
they're checking license plates!

343
13:43.679 --> 13:45.399
Any car with local plates,

344
13:45.840 --> 13:47.080
they pull over and search.

345
13:47.320 --> 13:48.120
What?

346
13:49.720 --> 13:50.000
Wait,

347
13:50.000 --> 13:50.720
then... then...

348
13:51.000 --> 13:52.240
If local plates aren't allowed in,

349
13:52.240 --> 13:53.840
out-of-town cars must be allowed, right?

350
13:53.960 --> 13:54.639
I have no idea!

351
13:54.879 --> 13:55.799
What are you all huddled up for?

352
13:55.919 --> 13:56.639
Xuemei!

353
13:56.720 --> 13:57.639
She's in Qingzhou!

354
13:57.759 --> 13:58.200
Right!

355
13:58.480 --> 13:59.919
She went to pay the deposit for us!

356
14:00.080 --> 14:00.320
Exactly!

357
14:00.320 --> 14:00.679
Let Xuemei go!

358
14:00.679 --> 14:01.679
Have Xuemei get a non-local car,

359
14:01.679 --> 14:02.360
and she can just go right in!

360
14:02.399 --> 14:02.720
That's right!

361
14:02.720 --> 14:03.440
The problem is,

362
14:03.440 --> 14:04.639
how do we contact Xuemei right now?

363
14:04.679 --> 14:05.159
How do we reach her? Listen to me!

364
14:05.159 --> 14:06.120
Listen to me! Listen!

365
14:06.639 --> 14:07.840
Xuemei and I made a deal.

366
14:08.080 --> 14:09.360
As soon as she pays the deposit,

367
14:09.399 --> 14:10.639
she'll call me!

368
14:10.840 --> 14:11.120
Then...

369
14:11.159 --> 14:12.399
Then what are you doing standing here?

370
14:12.440 --> 14:13.759
Go wait by the phone, quick!

371
14:13.799 --> 14:14.480
Stay safe!

372
14:14.480 --> 14:14.799
All right!

373
14:15.240 --> 14:15.960
You guys stay safe too!

374
14:15.960 --> 14:16.720
Go wait for the call!

375
14:19.159 --> 14:20.679
What—what are we gonna do?

376
14:27.159 --> 14:27.720
Head back!

377
14:35.120 --> 14:35.759
To the venue!

378
14:36.080 --> 14:36.639
Go to the venue!

379
14:37.039 --> 14:37.480
Get back!

380
15:02.399 --> 15:02.840
Boss.

381
15:02.879 --> 15:03.600
Can I make a call?

382
15:03.639 --> 15:04.159
Go ahead.

383
15:11.279 --> 15:11.720
Hello?

384
15:12.320 --> 15:13.000
Hello, Chunyan.

385
15:13.320 --> 15:13.759
It's me.

386
15:13.799 --> 15:14.600
It's Xuemei.

387
15:14.960 --> 15:16.799
Deposit paid at Qingzhou's head office.

388
15:17.200 --> 15:18.200
I got paddle number seven.

389
15:18.519 --> 15:19.559
Give my name and you can get in.

390
15:20.080 --> 15:20.679
Xuemei.

391
15:20.879 --> 15:21.919
Things have gone bad here.

392
15:22.519 --> 15:23.600
Ma Guowen blocked

393
15:23.600 --> 15:25.080
all the gates to our factory.

394
15:25.080 --> 15:26.120
None of us can get out.

395
15:26.600 --> 15:28.120
I also heard the auction venue

396
15:28.279 --> 15:29.279
has been blocked off.

397
15:29.519 --> 15:30.360
Cars with local plates

398
15:30.360 --> 15:31.360
can't get anywhere near it.

399
15:32.799 --> 15:33.519
Then what do we do?

400
15:33.879 --> 15:34.600
Director Chen said

401
15:34.840 --> 15:36.639
you should take a cab from Qingzhou

402
15:37.039 --> 15:38.080
straight to the auction,

403
15:38.240 --> 15:38.799
raise the paddle,

404
15:38.919 --> 15:39.759
and bid on our behalf.

405
15:39.799 --> 15:40.440
Hurry!

406
15:41.200 --> 15:41.559
Okay.

407
15:41.919 --> 15:42.679
I'll head back right away.

408
15:45.200 --> 15:45.919
Two yuan.

409
15:46.759 --> 15:47.320
How much?

410
15:47.879 --> 15:48.799
That was a long-distance call.

411
15:58.399 --> 15:58.840
Stop.

412
15:59.279 --> 16:00.120
Rewind it a bit.

413
16:01.360 --> 16:02.919
South Sixth Street.

414
16:03.559 --> 16:04.840
Near the Lapi Brewery compound.

415
16:04.960 --> 16:05.360
Yeah.

416
16:05.720 --> 16:06.720
Do you have another angle?

417
16:07.279 --> 16:08.039
Look for one.

418
16:10.000 --> 16:10.600
How about this?

419
16:19.799 --> 16:20.440
This person...

420
16:21.039 --> 16:21.879
Can you zoom in?

421
16:22.320 --> 16:22.759
Sure.

422
16:28.480 --> 16:29.360
Stop, stop, stop.

423
16:29.559 --> 16:29.840
Stop.

424
16:31.559 --> 16:32.120
Hold on a second.

425
16:43.200 --> 16:44.440
After talking to you last time,

426
16:44.840 --> 16:46.000
I secretly followed him.

427
16:46.559 --> 16:49.159
He went to the Lapi Brewery family dorms,

428
16:49.519 --> 16:50.639
right around our neighborhood.

429
16:50.960 --> 16:52.000
He wandered around for a long time.

430
16:52.200 --> 16:53.720
I pulled back so I wouldn't tip him off.

431
16:55.799 --> 16:56.960
Let me warn you once more:

432
16:57.480 --> 16:58.919
don't go acting on your own.

433
17:00.039 --> 17:01.480
He's a cop, after all.

434
17:01.960 --> 17:03.399
He could easily be on a case.

435
17:04.359 --> 17:05.519
Cao Jun is in our compound.

436
17:05.880 --> 17:07.200
The police will definitely look for clues.

437
17:08.839 --> 17:09.680
My classmate said that

438
17:09.680 --> 17:11.640
after Gao Xuelin graduated from the academy,

439
17:11.640 --> 17:12.640
he was assigned to Qingzhou.

440
17:13.200 --> 17:14.400
He applied several times

441
17:14.400 --> 17:15.440
before he got transferred to Lacheng.

442
17:15.839 --> 17:17.119
Ordinarily,

443
17:17.160 --> 17:18.599
Lacheng is smaller than Qingzhou.

444
17:19.000 --> 17:20.400
People always want to climb higher,

445
17:20.400 --> 17:21.319
yet he went the opposite way.

446
17:21.920 --> 17:23.039
That's pretty unusual too.

447
17:24.559 --> 17:26.039
Did you find anything on his parents?

448
17:26.480 --> 17:27.119
I did.

449
17:27.519 --> 17:28.799
It says both his parents are gone.

450
17:28.920 --> 17:30.160
He's always lived with his grandma.

451
17:30.599 --> 17:31.640
His parents...

452
17:32.160 --> 17:33.079
they're both dead.

453
17:34.400 --> 17:35.279
Not sure what happened to them.

454
17:47.759 --> 17:48.359
Get out.

455
17:57.319 --> 17:57.920
Come in.

456
18:19.519 --> 18:20.279
Explain yourself.

457
18:23.799 --> 18:24.720
I was just wandering around.

458
18:25.559 --> 18:26.319
Wandering around?

459
18:26.799 --> 18:27.799
You were casing the place, weren't you?

460
18:29.599 --> 18:30.279
Xiao Gao.

461
18:31.359 --> 18:32.720
In the few days you've been here,

462
18:34.200 --> 18:34.920
making up lies,

463
18:35.720 --> 18:36.279
playing dumb,

464
18:36.680 --> 18:37.200
wandering around...

465
18:38.200 --> 18:39.240
That's your whole repertoire, isn't it?

466
18:40.000 --> 18:40.480
No.

467
18:41.359 --> 18:42.119
Then what else do you have?

468
18:43.359 --> 18:44.359
Do you know what your job is?

469
18:45.319 --> 18:46.160
You're a cop.

470
18:47.039 --> 18:48.240
You're not a private eye.

471
18:48.559 --> 18:49.880
Are you working side gigs?

472
18:50.680 --> 18:52.279
If you're taking side gigs, you'd better tell me.

473
18:52.759 --> 18:53.519
Let me tell you this.

474
18:54.880 --> 18:57.640
I don't care how you worked for Xu Qiang,

475
18:58.240 --> 19:00.640
but you're in the Lacheng CID now.

476
19:00.960 --> 19:02.480
You're under my command now.

477
19:02.599 --> 19:04.119
If anything happens to you, I'm responsible.

478
19:04.119 --> 19:04.839
You get that?

479
19:09.319 --> 19:11.079
I just wanted to look into Liu Xuemei's case.

480
19:13.759 --> 19:14.759
I think it's connected to Cao Jun

481
19:14.759 --> 19:16.400
and Ma Guowen's cases.

482
19:19.200 --> 19:21.480
I just want to know how she actually died back then.

483
19:21.480 --> 19:23.039
What happened before she died?

484
19:23.680 --> 19:24.480
Froze to death.

485
19:25.720 --> 19:27.119
Why can't you just let this go?

486
19:30.200 --> 19:31.240
Fine, I'll tell you one last time.

487
19:31.240 --> 19:32.200
Listen carefully.

488
19:33.680 --> 19:34.319
Liu Xuemei

489
19:34.680 --> 19:35.599
froze to death back then.

490
19:36.160 --> 19:37.720
Alcohol was found in her system.

491
19:38.160 --> 19:38.640
So,

492
19:38.759 --> 19:40.519
she suffered hypothermia while drunk

493
19:40.720 --> 19:41.240
and froze to death.

494
19:41.960 --> 19:42.319
She...

495
19:42.319 --> 19:43.440
A beer taster isn't allowed to drink.

496
19:44.079 --> 19:45.319
How could she have been drunk?

497
19:47.319 --> 19:48.599
Beer tasters aren't supposed to drink,

498
19:49.359 --> 19:50.200
but she did.

499
19:50.400 --> 19:50.960
So what?

500
19:51.359 --> 19:52.799
Then why didn't she go home afterward?

501
19:53.079 --> 19:54.079
Just sitting outside,

502
19:54.440 --> 19:55.720
sitting there on Millennium Eve?

503
19:56.559 --> 19:57.559
It was Millennium Eve.

504
19:57.720 --> 19:58.599
She was celebrating.

505
19:58.680 --> 19:59.680
Celebrating alone?

506
20:00.160 --> 20:01.440
Where were the people celebrating with her?

507
20:01.440 --> 20:02.319
Where did they go?

508
20:03.039 --> 20:04.480
She was celebrating by herself.

509
20:04.480 --> 20:05.240
What of it?

510
20:06.440 --> 20:08.319
Celebrating alone by a bench,

511
20:09.000 --> 20:09.559
sitting there all night?

512
20:10.240 --> 20:11.799
Were there any empty bottles around her?

513
20:12.200 --> 20:13.200
Didn't she drink?

514
20:22.200 --> 20:22.799
Xiao Gao,

515
20:24.759 --> 20:25.799
you're a sharp kid.

516
20:26.519 --> 20:27.119
Quick on your feet,

517
20:27.880 --> 20:28.559
inquisitive,

518
20:29.240 --> 20:30.200
always asking questions.

519
20:30.920 --> 20:31.799
But remember this:

520
20:32.880 --> 20:34.720
when you question me,

521
20:35.160 --> 20:36.039
fix your attitude, all right?

522
20:38.599 --> 20:39.279
And another thing,

523
20:40.279 --> 20:41.480
pulling you out here

524
20:41.480 --> 20:42.240
to talk in private

525
20:42.440 --> 20:43.400
was to save your face.

526
20:44.319 --> 20:45.799
Next time, no more acting on your own.

527
20:46.039 --> 20:47.759
If I catch you going rogue again,

528
20:48.000 --> 20:49.039
I'll send you back where you came from.

529
20:49.119 --> 20:49.880
Understood?

530
20:50.960 --> 20:51.559
Understood.

531
20:52.400 --> 20:52.920
Louder!

532
20:52.960 --> 20:53.599
Understood!

533
20:59.720 --> 21:00.920
It's good to think.

534
21:01.680 --> 21:03.000
Keep thinking, then.

535
21:07.720 --> 21:09.079
Am I supposed to think out here?

536
21:12.319 --> 21:13.279
Aren't you afraid of freezing to death?

537
21:14.680 --> 21:15.559
I am, I am, I am!

538
21:27.079 --> 21:27.640
What are you looking at?

539
21:35.119 --> 21:36.279
Wearing a chamber pot on your head late at night,

540
21:36.279 --> 21:37.440
what are you wandering around for?

541
21:40.559 --> 21:41.319
Looking like a total dumbass.

542
21:55.359 --> 21:55.880
Pedal faster!

543
22:55.319 --> 22:55.759
Captain Han.

544
22:56.799 --> 22:57.440
How is he?

545
22:58.000 --> 22:58.720
He's still breathing.

546
22:59.240 --> 22:59.880
He's still breathing.

547
23:01.440 --> 23:02.759
Isn't that Old Qian from the gate?

548
23:03.480 --> 23:04.039
Xiao Wu.

549
23:04.279 --> 23:05.039
Go with them.

550
23:05.039 --> 23:05.839
Do everything to save him!

551
23:05.880 --> 23:06.440
Got it, will do!

552
23:06.440 --> 23:07.640
Let me know the second there's any update.

553
23:07.680 --> 23:08.119
Right.

554
23:11.960 --> 23:12.799
Are there any cameras nearby?

555
23:12.920 --> 23:13.759
It's too remote out here.

556
23:14.759 --> 23:15.279
None at all.

557
23:16.160 --> 23:17.200
Put up police tape right now.

558
23:18.480 --> 23:20.559
Check all suspicious people and vehicles.

559
23:21.160 --> 23:22.480
Look for eyewitnesses.

560
23:23.240 --> 23:24.440
Take photos and collect evidence.

561
23:24.519 --> 23:24.920
Yes, sir!

562
23:47.640 --> 23:48.119
Xiao Gao,

563
23:48.519 --> 23:49.559
I'm going to the bathroom.

564
23:49.920 --> 23:51.480
Wait for me by that convenience store.

565
23:51.599 --> 23:52.720
I'll be right back.

566
24:14.720 --> 24:15.400
Where do you think you're going?

567
24:15.880 --> 24:16.839
I'm talking to you!

568
24:17.720 --> 24:18.279
Freeze!

569
24:20.000 --> 24:20.759
Stop right there!

570
24:22.400 --> 24:22.920
Don't move!

571
24:26.319 --> 24:26.920
Don't run!

572
24:36.319 --> 24:36.960
Where's Xiao Gao?

573
24:38.119 --> 24:38.799
Gao Xuelin!

574
24:39.279 --> 24:39.880
Gao Xuelin!

575
25:06.279 --> 25:07.240
Last night,

576
25:07.880 --> 25:08.960
what happened with you?

577
25:09.359 --> 25:10.359
Here's the thing, Captain Cheng.

578
25:11.200 --> 25:12.240
Last night,

579
25:13.279 --> 25:15.599
I stayed with my partner Cai Wenxiu.

580
25:16.000 --> 25:18.640
We were at the brewery compound,

581
25:19.279 --> 25:20.519
staking out downstairs

582
25:20.519 --> 25:21.839
to see if we could find any leads.

583
25:22.359 --> 25:23.599
Just for a brief moment,

584
25:23.720 --> 25:24.920
Sister Cai said she had to use the restroom,

585
25:25.079 --> 25:25.519
right?

586
25:25.720 --> 25:26.960
She told me to wait for her there.

587
25:27.960 --> 25:29.200
Coincidentally,

588
25:29.240 --> 25:30.359
right around that time,

589
25:30.759 --> 25:32.000
just as Sister Cai walked away,

590
25:32.000 --> 25:34.440
a guy came out of Shen Leshui's building.

591
25:34.720 --> 25:35.640
He was bundled up tight,

592
25:35.640 --> 25:36.799
so I couldn't see his face clearly.

593
25:36.839 --> 25:38.079
I called out, "What are you doing?"

594
25:38.519 --> 25:39.720
He took one look at me

595
25:40.079 --> 25:41.359
and turned and ran.

596
25:41.720 --> 25:43.000
So I chased after him the whole way.

597
25:43.160 --> 25:43.680
That's how

598
25:43.680 --> 25:44.759
the two of us got separated.

599
25:46.359 --> 25:48.079
Then why didn't you call Xiao Cai

600
25:48.799 --> 25:49.559
and notify the team?

601
25:49.759 --> 25:50.680
I was in hot pursuit,

602
25:50.680 --> 25:51.799
so I didn't have time!

603
25:52.319 --> 25:53.359
While I was chasing him,

604
25:53.359 --> 25:54.960
Sister Cai called me.

605
25:55.160 --> 25:56.839
In the snow, my hand slipped,

606
25:57.000 --> 25:58.279
and my phone hit the ground.

607
25:58.359 --> 26:00.319
By the time I looked up, he was gone.

608
26:00.519 --> 26:01.880
But I got some leads on the guy.

609
26:01.920 --> 26:04.279
He's between 180 and 185 centimeters tall,

610
26:05.319 --> 26:06.079
hard to tell his build,

611
26:06.079 --> 26:07.160
wearing a black padded jacket.

612
26:07.279 --> 26:08.359
He ran very fast,

613
26:08.559 --> 26:10.799
so he's definitely not older.

614
26:11.440 --> 26:12.119
Xiao Gao.

615
26:13.079 --> 26:14.000
Lately,

616
26:14.319 --> 26:15.640
you seem a bit too fixated

617
26:16.160 --> 26:17.359
on this Shen Leshui.

618
26:23.359 --> 26:24.480
What do you mean, Captain Cheng?

619
26:25.640 --> 26:27.279
Shen Leshui received a threat letter!

620
26:27.359 --> 26:28.279
As a detective,

621
26:28.279 --> 26:29.240
facing a situation like that,

622
26:29.279 --> 26:30.160
was I not supposed to chase him?

623
26:30.200 --> 26:32.400
Just wait for my partner to finish in the restroom?

624
26:32.440 --> 26:34.119
Why didn't you call Xiao Cai?

625
26:34.359 --> 26:35.079
Why didn't you notify the team?

626
26:35.759 --> 26:36.839
My phone broke!

627
26:36.839 --> 26:37.400
Look,

628
26:37.400 --> 26:38.920
it was smashed to pieces.

629
26:39.480 --> 26:41.279
And after I lost the guy,

630
26:41.480 --> 26:43.200
I searched the area for at least

631
26:43.200 --> 26:44.480
two to three hours.

632
26:45.119 --> 26:46.480
I think you were so eager for credit

633
26:46.920 --> 26:47.880
that you lost your cool.

634
26:48.960 --> 26:49.799
No, that's not it!

635
26:50.039 --> 26:51.319
It was all just a coincidence.

636
26:51.319 --> 26:52.960
If I hadn't taken that call,

637
26:53.039 --> 26:54.200
my phone wouldn't have broken.

638
26:54.200 --> 26:55.480
I would've reported to the team,

639
26:55.640 --> 26:57.079
and I definitely would've caught him!

640
26:57.079 --> 26:57.920
After all that talk,

641
26:58.039 --> 26:59.119
it's all someone else's fault.

642
26:59.319 --> 27:00.359
You're not to blame at all, right?

643
27:00.480 --> 27:01.240
Is that what you're saying?

644
27:01.319 --> 27:02.440
Well, I'm really confused.

645
27:02.440 --> 27:02.920
Captain,

646
27:03.039 --> 27:03.640
you've got to tell me

647
27:03.640 --> 27:04.640
what I did wrong.

648
27:04.640 --> 27:05.599
In my duties,

649
27:05.720 --> 27:07.160
where did I mess up?

650
27:08.920 --> 27:09.400
Get out.

651
27:09.920 --> 27:10.599
Cool off.

652
27:13.240 --> 27:14.039
He's your trainee.

653
27:14.160 --> 27:15.119
Teach him properly.

654
27:15.279 --> 27:16.119
Get out!

655
27:30.839 --> 27:31.559
Captain Cheng,

656
27:32.559 --> 27:33.920
I'll contact

657
27:34.160 --> 27:35.000
the local police station right away,

658
27:35.319 --> 27:36.319
pull up all the surveillance footage,

659
27:36.680 --> 27:38.440
and check the guy Gao Xuelin mentioned.

660
27:38.680 --> 27:40.279
Until this case is cleared up,

661
27:40.559 --> 27:41.480
suspend him from duty.

662
27:42.519 --> 27:43.319
Don't be mad.

663
27:43.799 --> 27:44.640
He's young.

664
27:45.759 --> 27:46.799
Nothing to get upset over.

665
27:46.960 --> 27:48.000
Passion is a good thing.

666
27:48.559 --> 27:49.359
Just guide him more.

667
27:50.079 --> 27:51.079
I have a meeting at the bureau.

668
27:51.319 --> 27:51.640
Okay.

669
27:51.720 --> 27:52.240
I'll head over first.

670
27:52.519 --> 27:53.279
If anything comes up,

671
27:53.599 --> 27:54.400
keep me posted, okay?

672
27:55.119 --> 27:56.079
All right, carry on.

673
27:56.519 --> 27:56.839
Get back to work.

674
28:00.119 --> 28:00.799
Wu,

675
28:02.039 --> 28:03.480
contact the local station

676
28:04.039 --> 28:04.839
and get the footage.

677
28:05.279 --> 28:06.160
Chuang, about that...

678
28:06.279 --> 28:07.559
I already reached out to the station.

679
28:07.680 --> 28:08.440
The footage will be here soon.

680
28:09.079 --> 28:09.799
Pretty sharp.

681
28:15.000 --> 28:15.480
Hello?

682
28:18.119 --> 28:18.519
Okay.

683
28:18.519 --> 28:19.880
I... I'll head over right now.

684
28:21.880 --> 28:23.279
Shen Leshui's place was broken into.

685
28:24.559 --> 28:25.640
You two, come with me.

686
28:26.240 --> 28:26.640
Sure.

687
28:35.839 --> 28:36.279
Chuang.

688
28:37.559 --> 28:38.359
Where are you guys going?

689
28:40.759 --> 28:42.319
Shen Leshui's place was burgled.

690
28:43.720 --> 28:44.880
Let me come along with you.

691
28:46.519 --> 28:47.519
You stay at the station.

692
28:47.839 --> 28:49.079
Until a decision comes down,

693
28:49.079 --> 28:49.880
don't go anywhere.

694
28:51.119 --> 28:51.680
Wu,

695
28:51.960 --> 28:53.119
you're not coming with us either.

696
28:54.200 --> 28:54.880
Keep an eye on him.

697
28:55.119 --> 28:55.680
Got it.

698
28:58.799 --> 28:59.839
Chuang, I need to talk to you.

699
29:01.920 --> 29:03.000
Can you spare a minute?

700
29:03.400 --> 29:04.319
It's really important.

701
29:13.920 --> 29:14.839
Go downstairs and start the car.

702
29:19.880 --> 29:20.440
Go ahead.

703
29:26.480 --> 29:27.359
Chuang, I know

704
29:28.759 --> 29:30.559
you've never really trusted me.

705
29:32.359 --> 29:33.759
Of course, that's on me.

706
29:36.480 --> 29:38.200
After thinking it over today,

707
29:39.279 --> 29:40.759
there's something I must tell you.

708
30:05.599 --> 30:06.720
When did you realize they were gone?

709
30:07.440 --> 30:08.000
Last night.

710
30:08.640 --> 30:09.720
When I got back from a friend's place,

711
30:09.839 --> 30:10.839
I found the lock had been picked.

712
30:11.480 --> 30:12.200
What was stolen?

713
30:12.960 --> 30:13.519
Tapes.

714
30:14.160 --> 30:14.880
Only the tapes?

715
30:15.720 --> 30:16.400
Where were they kept?

716
30:16.799 --> 30:17.599
Over by the desk.

717
30:25.240 --> 30:25.799
Aren't these still here?

718
30:26.160 --> 30:26.920
Not these.

719
30:27.359 --> 30:29.359
All unused Malt Kingdom footage is gone.

720
30:29.960 --> 30:30.519
How many tapes?

721
30:31.000 --> 30:32.200
A shoebox with 13 tapes.

722
30:32.720 --> 30:33.279
All gone.

723
30:37.839 --> 30:40.079
The ones Xiao Gao wanted to see last time, right?

724
30:40.960 --> 30:41.519
Yes.

725
30:42.720 --> 30:43.480
Why isn't he here?

726
30:44.839 --> 30:45.640
He's on another assignment.

727
30:48.160 --> 30:48.839
Well...

728
30:49.039 --> 30:50.200
Do you have a backup of the footage?

729
30:51.480 --> 30:52.799
I was just about to back it up.

730
30:52.960 --> 30:54.200
Didn't expect the thief to strike so fast.

731
30:59.400 --> 31:01.079
Only the unused footage was stolen?

732
31:02.799 --> 31:03.359
Yes.

733
31:30.519 --> 31:31.079
What?

734
31:31.359 --> 31:32.319
Caught a cold?

735
31:33.079 --> 31:34.200
Go out in just a thin shirt

736
31:34.359 --> 31:36.079
and take a stroll, see what happens.

737
31:40.680 --> 31:41.759
That's a pretty deep cough.

738
31:42.920 --> 31:43.960
You pissed me off so bad I'm wheezing.

739
31:44.799 --> 31:45.359
If it doesn't get better soon,

740
31:45.400 --> 31:46.640
I'll have the nurse give you some meds.

741
31:47.319 --> 31:48.079
Put it on my tab.

742
31:48.759 --> 31:49.319
What?

743
31:49.319 --> 31:50.079
Your treat?

744
31:51.319 --> 31:52.319
My treat, of course.

745
31:55.559 --> 31:56.359
Does it hurt?

746
31:57.119 --> 31:58.559
What's the filling?

747
32:00.759 --> 32:01.799
Pickled cabbage.

748
32:02.160 --> 32:03.240
Did you put pork cracklings in?

749
32:04.799 --> 32:05.359
Sure did.

750
32:06.240 --> 32:07.160
Hurry up and let me taste one.

751
32:07.160 --> 32:08.240
They'll get cold soon.

752
32:09.319 --> 32:09.960
You're clutching my hand.

753
32:09.960 --> 32:10.880
How am I supposed to grab them?

754
32:17.680 --> 32:18.720
Look at you.

755
32:23.000 --> 32:23.480
Here.

756
32:26.680 --> 32:27.240
Hot!

757
32:27.559 --> 32:28.200
Still piping hot. Careful, slow down.

758
32:30.319 --> 32:31.559
Did you get a good look?

759
32:32.319 --> 32:33.359
Who beat you up?

760
32:33.519 --> 32:34.200
Didn't see clearly.

761
32:35.400 --> 32:36.079
Pitch-black out,

762
32:36.400 --> 32:37.319
pitch-black guy.

763
32:37.960 --> 32:39.240
An assassin from Africa?

764
32:39.920 --> 32:40.960
An international hit job?

765
32:45.839 --> 32:46.960
Who the hell was it?

766
32:47.839 --> 32:48.880
If I ever catch him,

767
32:49.319 --> 32:50.240
I'll rip his hip right off.

768
32:53.000 --> 32:54.000
What're you laughing at?

769
32:54.000 --> 32:54.759
You knucklehead.

770
32:58.160 --> 32:58.839
Let me tell you,

771
32:59.799 --> 33:00.920
dying is really no big deal.

772
33:02.880 --> 33:03.839
The only thing I'd miss

773
33:03.839 --> 33:04.920
is your pickled cabbage dumplings.

774
33:06.400 --> 33:07.359
Even that won't shut your mouth.

775
33:09.359 --> 33:10.119
They're really good.

776
33:10.680 --> 33:11.400
Gimme another one.

777
33:11.920 --> 33:13.079
Think I'm a piggy bank?

778
33:14.440 --> 33:15.079
I'm choking!

779
33:15.160 --> 33:15.920
Get me some water!

780
33:40.839 --> 33:41.440
What are you doing?

781
33:43.559 --> 33:44.519
Paying your last respects?

782
33:53.759 --> 33:55.680
Why do you three have chamber pots on your heads too?

783
33:57.799 --> 33:58.680
Not dead.

784
34:03.920 --> 34:04.759
Didn't die.

785
34:06.720 --> 34:07.680
Did you see who did it?

786
34:08.079 --> 34:08.679
I saw him.

787
34:09.760 --> 34:10.480
Someone I know.

788
34:12.440 --> 34:13.320
Someone you know?

789
34:14.480 --> 34:15.079
Who was it?

790
34:26.800 --> 34:27.559
Cao Jun!

791
34:30.480 --> 34:32.000
Are you crazy?

792
34:32.639 --> 34:33.760
I'll beat the crap out of you!

793
34:36.960 --> 34:37.480
Serves you right.

794
34:37.880 --> 34:38.480
It really hurts.

795
34:39.320 --> 34:40.079
Hey, we came

796
34:40.880 --> 34:42.599
all this way to see you,

797
34:43.360 --> 34:44.519
and my car even broke down.

798
34:45.119 --> 34:46.159
We had to take Tieping's

799
34:46.679 --> 34:47.719
three-wheeler here.

800
34:47.719 --> 34:48.679
Think it was easy for us?

801
34:49.239 --> 34:50.400
What car broke down?

802
34:50.760 --> 34:52.440
You just got a little money and had to show off.

803
34:52.599 --> 34:54.320
That siren ride I got this time

804
34:54.559 --> 34:55.440
was way better than yours.

805
34:55.639 --> 34:56.599
In that thing, you close your eyes,

806
34:56.719 --> 34:57.280
stretch out your legs,

807
34:57.360 --> 34:58.599
pure bliss, I'm telling you.

808
34:59.159 --> 35:00.400
What's so great about having a car?

809
35:01.119 --> 35:02.400
Then why didn't you just die?

810
35:04.440 --> 35:05.880
You barely recover and you're already showing off?

811
35:06.280 --> 35:07.840
Why don't you just drop dead, then?

812
35:10.199 --> 35:11.360
Don't get smart with me, I'm telling you.

813
35:12.800 --> 35:13.800
The day I catch that punk,

814
35:13.840 --> 35:15.559
I'll slap him twice across the face first.

815
35:15.559 --> 35:16.119
I'm telling you,

816
35:16.960 --> 35:18.199
he did such a half-assed job!

817
35:19.199 --> 35:19.960
If he'd put a little more muscle into it,

818
35:19.960 --> 35:21.480
hit me a couple more times, it'd be done!

819
35:21.559 --> 35:22.880
I'd have gone straight to join Cao Jun!

820
35:23.559 --> 35:24.840
All right, all right, all right.

821
35:24.960 --> 35:25.599
Stop showing off.

822
35:26.280 --> 35:27.199
Count your blessings.

823
35:28.280 --> 35:30.079
Chunyan has been looking after you.

824
35:30.400 --> 35:31.000
Right?

825
35:32.199 --> 35:33.000
You just

826
35:33.239 --> 35:34.320
focus on recovering

827
35:35.840 --> 35:37.559
and cooperate with the police.

828
35:38.440 --> 35:39.400
Let's try our best

829
35:39.800 --> 35:41.360
to catch that bastard soon.

830
35:41.880 --> 35:42.840
That's what really counts,

831
35:45.119 --> 35:45.639
right?

832
35:52.960 --> 35:53.480
Alright, then.

833
35:55.039 --> 35:55.599
We're taking off.

834
35:55.599 --> 35:56.159
Let's roll.

835
35:56.840 --> 35:57.519
Leaving already?

836
36:04.239 --> 36:04.920
Hold this for me.

837
36:08.960 --> 36:10.679
Didn't knock you stupid, did he?

838
36:13.039 --> 36:13.719
Look at you.

839
36:13.719 --> 36:14.800
You didn't have to bring anything,

840
36:15.079 --> 36:15.840
buying food to nurse me up.

841
36:16.119 --> 36:16.760
What about you two?

842
36:16.760 --> 36:17.840
Did you two come empty-handed?

843
36:19.199 --> 36:20.480
I'll stew an old hen for you later

844
36:21.360 --> 36:22.280
to build your strength back up.

845
36:23.559 --> 36:24.119
We're off.

846
36:26.239 --> 36:27.199
Thanks, Haipeng.

847
36:27.599 --> 36:28.840
It barely cost anything.

848
36:32.199 --> 36:32.760
Fasten it over here.

849
36:32.920 --> 36:33.599
It won't buckle.

850
36:34.000 --> 36:34.679
Drive safe!

851
36:43.320 --> 36:46.280
If it were back in the day, that money...

852
36:50.760 --> 36:51.559
Exactly.

853
36:52.400 --> 36:54.360
She promised me she'd go to the auction.

854
36:55.039 --> 36:56.679
So how did she freeze to death?

855
37:03.519 --> 37:05.559
What happened to Xuemei...

856
37:07.679 --> 37:08.440
...it's fishy.

857
37:11.519 --> 37:12.000
Old Chen,

858
37:12.000 --> 37:13.039
what—what are you getting at?

859
37:20.400 --> 37:21.800
Someone from the factory office,

860
37:22.559 --> 37:24.840
one of Ma Guowen's people, told me...

861
37:25.480 --> 37:26.320
...that yesterday,

862
37:28.559 --> 37:30.840
Ma Guowen and Xuemei...

863
37:31.400 --> 37:33.480
...shut the door in a private room

864
37:34.559 --> 37:35.679
and whispered for ages.

865
37:37.440 --> 37:38.360
And after that,

866
37:38.880 --> 37:40.000
Xuemei just left.

867
37:41.480 --> 37:42.920
The moment the auction started,

868
37:44.880 --> 37:45.760
she walked out.

869
37:46.280 --> 37:46.880
Then...

870
37:48.960 --> 37:49.440
what are you saying?

871
37:49.480 --> 37:51.320
Liu Xuemei sold us out?

872
37:51.320 --> 37:52.280
She's a traitor?

873
37:53.440 --> 37:54.400
I never said that.

874
37:54.679 --> 37:55.360
That's what you're implying!

875
37:55.800 --> 37:56.440
That's impossible!

876
37:59.800 --> 38:01.719
We were all locked inside the factory then.

877
38:02.559 --> 38:04.480
Xuemei was called over at the last minute, too.

878
38:04.480 --> 38:05.760
How could she be a traitor?

879
38:06.360 --> 38:06.960
Why couldn't she be?

880
38:06.960 --> 38:08.159
She went into that private room!

881
38:09.119 --> 38:09.559
So what?

882
38:09.559 --> 38:10.400
Going into a private room makes her a traitor?

883
38:10.400 --> 38:10.960
That's enough!

884
38:11.280 --> 38:12.039
She's already dead.

885
38:12.880 --> 38:13.639
Drop it, both of you.

886
38:20.039 --> 38:21.239
Today, Ma Guowen...

887
38:21.360 --> 38:22.440
held meetings with every workshop,

888
38:23.760 --> 38:24.679
and said only one thing.

889
38:26.719 --> 38:27.360
What's that?

890
38:28.760 --> 38:29.480
Catch the ringleaders.

891
38:37.159 --> 38:38.639
What's that mean? Go ahead and arrest me!

892
38:39.840 --> 38:40.280
Come arrest me!

893
38:40.320 --> 38:40.840
Tie me up!

894
38:41.039 --> 38:41.599
Come on, take me, take me!

895
38:41.599 --> 38:42.440
Turn me in! What's it to you anyway?

896
38:42.440 --> 38:43.280
Come on, come on. Enough, cut it out.

897
38:43.280 --> 38:43.840
Come on!

898
38:44.360 --> 38:45.039
You always stick your neck out for everything.

899
38:45.079 --> 38:45.719
What do you mean by that?

900
38:47.079 --> 38:48.280
You've got nothing to worry about.

901
38:49.360 --> 38:50.119
You're a bachelor.

902
38:50.360 --> 38:50.960
Right?

903
38:51.400 --> 38:52.000
But think about it.

904
38:52.039 --> 38:53.559
There are so many people on that list.

905
38:54.679 --> 38:56.320
Everyone has a family to support.

906
38:56.559 --> 38:57.440
Right, exactly.

907
38:58.239 --> 38:59.480
Old Chen makes a good point.

908
39:00.440 --> 39:01.360
I think regarding this matter,

909
39:01.719 --> 39:03.480
we absolutely can't let Ma Guowen find out

910
39:03.559 --> 39:04.800
about our list.

911
39:05.000 --> 39:05.679
Right, exactly.

912
39:05.880 --> 39:06.480
Now,

913
39:06.519 --> 39:07.599
Xiao Tu, keep it safe.

914
39:07.599 --> 39:09.000
We have to keep it well hidden.

915
39:09.679 --> 39:11.239
But now another problem has come up.

916
39:11.239 --> 39:11.800
What problem?

917
39:11.880 --> 39:13.440
We didn't get our factory back,

918
39:13.920 --> 39:15.480
and we haven't gotten our money back either.

919
39:15.639 --> 39:16.840
Rest easy.

920
39:16.840 --> 39:18.199
The money is at the auction house.

921
39:18.559 --> 39:19.800
I know it's at the auction house.

922
39:20.159 --> 39:21.599
But we can't just leave it sitting there.

923
39:21.719 --> 39:23.559
Having it in our own hands would give us peace of mind.

924
39:24.039 --> 39:24.760
That's a lot of money.

925
39:25.000 --> 39:26.400
Right, we have to get it back.

926
39:26.800 --> 39:27.159
Exactly.

927
39:27.239 --> 39:27.800
Just think about it.

928
39:28.000 --> 39:29.320
We're only about a hundred people.

929
39:29.320 --> 39:30.400
How hard was it to scrape together that 500,000?

930
39:30.519 --> 39:31.000
It's a huge sum.

931
39:31.000 --> 39:31.320
Isn't it?

932
39:31.320 --> 39:31.719
Right.

933
39:32.639 --> 39:33.119
Chief Engineer Chen,

934
39:33.599 --> 39:34.480
how much did you drop with one wave of your hand?

935
39:34.559 --> 39:35.119
Fifty thousand.

936
39:35.239 --> 39:35.760
How much did you put in,

937
39:35.760 --> 39:36.119
Old Cao?

938
39:36.119 --> 39:36.480
Four thousand.

939
39:36.480 --> 39:37.280
My entire life savings went into that.

940
39:37.280 --> 39:37.960
You see?

941
39:38.360 --> 39:39.119
Normally speaking,

942
39:39.239 --> 39:39.559
Yeah.

943
39:39.599 --> 39:41.360
Xuemei handled the paperwork.

944
39:41.400 --> 39:41.800
Yeah.

945
39:41.880 --> 39:42.519
So to withdraw the money,

946
39:42.519 --> 39:43.280
Xuemei has to be the one to do it.

947
39:43.360 --> 39:43.719
That's right.

948
39:43.719 --> 39:44.559
But right now, she's...

949
39:44.599 --> 39:45.800
gone, isn't she?

950
39:45.920 --> 39:47.159
We can't just keep waiting around.

951
39:47.239 --> 39:48.760
I was thinking, shouldn't we find someone

952
39:48.800 --> 39:50.000
to go ask at the auction house?

953
39:50.000 --> 39:50.400
Yeah, right.

954
39:50.400 --> 39:50.920
I'll go.

955
39:51.719 --> 39:52.360
Let me go.

956
39:52.840 --> 39:53.400
You can't.

957
39:54.360 --> 39:54.880
Why not?

958
39:55.159 --> 39:56.360
You'll drag the rest of us into it.

959
39:56.639 --> 39:57.239
Right, exactly.

960
39:57.519 --> 39:58.440
You can't go.

961
39:59.320 --> 40:00.960
We can't pick someone from our circle.

962
40:01.039 --> 40:01.920
We have to find someone

963
40:02.000 --> 40:04.159
who has nothing to do with our circle.

964
40:20.280 --> 40:21.880
You don't actually...

965
40:22.360 --> 40:23.840
want me to go, do you?

966
40:24.800 --> 40:25.480
Exactly.

967
40:26.159 --> 40:27.760
Leshui isn't in our circle,

968
40:28.000 --> 40:28.800
so she's the best fit.

969
40:28.880 --> 40:29.119
Yeah.

970
40:29.119 --> 40:30.119
No, no, no.

971
40:30.280 --> 40:30.719
No way.

972
40:30.960 --> 40:31.519
Look...

973
40:31.920 --> 40:32.519
Reporter Shen,

974
40:32.559 --> 40:33.239
no offense meant,

975
40:33.239 --> 40:34.320
but let me speak my mind.

976
40:35.599 --> 40:38.039
Back when we discussed this,

977
40:38.320 --> 40:39.400
wasn't it to keep it from Ma Guowen?

978
40:39.480 --> 40:40.960
Just a few of us here in private,

979
40:40.960 --> 40:42.000
without any outsiders around?

980
40:42.280 --> 40:43.440
So how did Ma Guowen find out later?

981
40:43.760 --> 40:44.840
Back then, wasn't the only outsider...

982
40:45.800 --> 40:46.280
her?

983
40:47.639 --> 40:48.000
Her!

984
40:48.000 --> 40:48.719
What's that supposed to mean?

985
40:50.519 --> 40:52.199
What did Leshui do to you now?

986
40:53.800 --> 40:54.960
One minute you suspect this person,

987
40:54.960 --> 40:55.800
the next you suspect that person.

988
40:56.000 --> 40:56.639
What's your deal, Cao Jun?

989
40:56.639 --> 40:57.960
What are you trying to pull?

990
40:58.159 --> 40:58.840
I'm not pulling anything.

991
40:58.920 --> 40:59.320
Haipeng.

992
40:59.760 --> 41:00.039
Look,

993
41:00.039 --> 41:01.320
I know you two are dating,

994
41:01.719 --> 41:03.199
but hear me out.

995
41:03.199 --> 41:04.480
She's the only outsider here.

996
41:04.679 --> 41:06.519
What if she actually takes the money?

997
41:06.639 --> 41:06.960
You—

998
41:07.079 --> 41:07.920
Leaving the money in an outsider's hands...

999
41:07.920 --> 41:09.960
What does this have to do with us dating?

1000
41:10.119 --> 41:10.519
Fine, fine, fine.

1001
41:10.519 --> 41:11.119
She... I...

1002
41:11.119 --> 41:11.519
Right, right, right.

1003
41:11.519 --> 41:12.079
You make a good point.

1004
41:12.440 --> 41:13.239
Then why don't you go?

1005
41:13.559 --> 41:14.119
Me? I...

1006
41:14.280 --> 41:15.199
How can I go?

1007
41:15.199 --> 41:15.880
Can I even go?

1008
41:16.039 --> 41:17.000
I'm just a driver.

1009
41:17.000 --> 41:17.760
How am I supposed to go?

1010
41:17.920 --> 41:18.960
I don't even know

1011
41:18.960 --> 41:19.719
where the auction is being held.

1012
41:19.719 --> 41:20.199
How am I supposed to go?

1013
41:20.199 --> 41:20.920
I can't go.

1014
41:21.519 --> 41:22.480
Then that settles it.

1015
41:29.960 --> 41:31.280
This is an unusual situation.

1016
41:32.239 --> 41:33.360
Everyone's anxious,

1017
41:35.000 --> 41:36.079
so it's natural you'd suspect me.

1018
41:37.880 --> 41:39.079
But right now, only I

1019
41:39.519 --> 41:41.800
can go ask the auction house for you all.

1020
41:42.039 --> 41:42.880
Leshui, you're not going.

1021
41:44.159 --> 41:45.320
They don't even trust you.

1022
41:45.840 --> 41:46.599
Why bother going?

1023
41:47.920 --> 41:48.719
Stay out of this.

1024
41:53.280 --> 41:53.800
How about this?

1025
41:54.960 --> 41:55.920
You all come with me.

1026
41:56.159 --> 41:57.280
Keep watch outside,

1027
41:58.519 --> 41:59.440
and I'll go in alone.

1028
42:00.039 --> 42:00.960
When registering names,

1029
42:01.039 --> 42:02.440
I'll only put down mine.

1030
42:03.280 --> 42:04.440
You won't be exposed.

1031
42:24.800 --> 42:25.360
Hello.

1032
42:25.559 --> 42:26.239
How can I help you?

1033
42:26.559 --> 42:27.039
Hello.

1034
42:27.480 --> 42:28.920
I'm here to retrieve a deposit.

1035
42:29.880 --> 42:30.920
On the 30th of last month,

1036
42:30.920 --> 42:31.760
from Lapi Brewery,

1037
42:32.039 --> 42:33.760
our representative, Liu Xuemei,

1038
42:34.239 --> 42:35.719
paid 500,000

1039
42:35.719 --> 42:37.440
as an auction deposit.

1040
42:37.760 --> 42:38.960
You should have a record of it here.

1041
42:39.079 --> 42:39.679
All right.

1042
42:41.000 --> 42:42.119
Here's the thing.

1043
42:42.880 --> 42:44.480
She unfortunately passed away.

1044
42:45.280 --> 42:46.199
But this money

1045
42:46.239 --> 42:48.519
was pooled by many of us workers.

1046
42:49.000 --> 42:50.400
In this situation,

1047
42:50.559 --> 42:53.239
how can we get this money back?

1048
42:53.880 --> 42:54.599
Here's how it works.

1049
42:54.800 --> 42:55.599
For pooled funds,

1050
42:55.679 --> 42:57.440
all contributors must give authorization

1051
42:57.440 --> 42:58.199
to make a withdrawal.

1052
42:58.599 --> 42:59.280
I'm sorry.

1053
42:59.440 --> 43:00.880
Everyone?

1054
43:01.920 --> 43:03.960
Does every single person have to sign?

1055
43:04.199 --> 43:04.679
Yes.

1056
43:21.159 --> 43:22.639
Liu Xuemei's death—

1057
43:22.880 --> 43:24.519
was it tied to Gao Wusong,

1058
43:25.360 --> 43:26.400
or

1059
43:27.320 --> 43:29.000
were they murdered together?

1060
43:31.559 --> 43:32.599
Maybe this whole thing

1061
43:32.800 --> 43:34.159
got back to people at the brewery,

1062
43:34.800 --> 43:35.519
so

1063
43:36.039 --> 43:38.559
you're burying the truth for your father.

1064
43:39.239 --> 43:39.960
That's why

1065
43:40.880 --> 43:42.679
you stole my tape.
